# Day 14 Ratio Edge Case Audit

Generated from the completed Day 14 validation database.

- Total logged anomalies: 1,191
- Threshold: absolute source-vs-engine difference > 5 percentage points
- ROCE/ROE anomalies are recorded with company, year, source value, engine value, difference, category, and reason.
- Current automated category: formula discrepancy.
- Final team-lead review is still required before treating every anomaly as fully explained, because source/version differences can require human review.
